<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus invites tenders for 25,000 tonnes of barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus invites tenders for 25,000 tonnes of barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain commission on Wednesday invited tenders for the supply of 25,000 tonnes of feed barley for shipment between January 15 and 30.</p>
<p>The tender closing date is January 10, the grain commission said in a statement.</p>
</text>
